window.products.push({"id":312089,"name":"MosesMo Stainless Steel Stemless Wine Glasses 18 Oz | Unbreakable & Shatterproof Glasses For Red & White Wine, Drinks, Champagne, Cocktails & More, Ch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817-cRpWXhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"At Last, The Most Durable Yet Elegant Stemless Wine Glasses Have Just Been Released! Wine Lovers Wait No More! Tired of cheaply made wine glasses? Worry about fragile drinking glasses? Looking for stylish yet ergonomic stainless steel tumblers? If so, then you should keep on reading. Designed with your best interest at heart, these stemless glasses are here to stay! Add a set in your kitchen arsenal today and surprise your guests at the next wine tasting gathering! Preserve Coolness For Much Longer With A MosesMo Stainless Steel Wine Glass Whether you are a diehard wine fan or just enjoying the occasional wine every once in a while, this set is an absolute must! You can now enjoy your tasty and rich in flavor wines, like Cabernet Sauvignon, Carmenere, Malbec, Merlot, Sauvignon Blanc, Muscat, Sémillon, and so many more. These modern glasses are perfect for cocktail nights, camping adventures, theme parties, and birthday celebrations. Their excellent craftsmanship will preserve coolness for much longer and enhance all the rich wine aromas! Still Not Sure If These Stemless Wine Glasses Are The Right Ones For You? Premium quality stainless steel wine glasses. Smooth lip for easy drinking! Unbreakable and shatterproof glasses. No more mess and glass fragments on the floor. For white, rosé, red and black wine - champagne, cocktails, drinks, sodas, alcoholic beverages and whiskey. Keep drinks chilled for much longer. Perfect for camping, outdoor RV trips or picnics. Large 18 Oz capacity! More wine, more fun! Sleek, classy and cool design glasses. For any kitchen bench or bar table! What are you waiting for? Get yours today, while supplies last! Scroll Up & Click Add To Cart Now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817-cRpWXhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MosesMo","source_asin":"B01MRCSCR2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-312089","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MRCSCR2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MRCSCR2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":312090,"name":"Dar Core Two-Tier Folding Desk, 30\" Wide, Gray Oak/Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71788UPWg-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Working from home just got even easier with the Core Folding Two-Tier Desk. The simple yet highly functional design allows you to have the ideal balance of a professional workstation at home, without taking up a lot of space. Because the desk is so airy and sleek, it blends into even the most cozy spaces such as a studio apartment, bedroom, living area nook, and more. The main table top surface is ideal for a laptop plus your most utilized devices, and room for a coffee cup, of course. The second tier adds that little extra that goes a long way, and it's perfect for those extras, like charging stations, headphones, extra monitor, clip camera, and more. It's the perfect size and configuration for virtual office meetings, doing online coursework, teaching virtual classes, and of course, blogging. The smart design allows you to completely fold the table flat for easy transport and storage when not in use. It's the workstation desk that does what you want it to. The elegant gray oak finish complements any space, and the sturdy, easy-to-clean surfaces are a breeze to take care of. No assembly required.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71788UPWg-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dar","source_asin":"B08HR66PXC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-312090","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HR66PXC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HR66PXC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
