window.products.push({"id":312116,"name":"Maura Premium Hand Towels 100% Cotton 16x30 Oversized Ultra Absorbent Quick Dry Soft Towels for Bathroom Extra Large Hand Towels, Cool Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":38.65,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1aUWCavuUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DURABILITY: Tested with over 200 stay at home moms to see the outcomes of our perfect new bath linens line. Results are outstanding! Easy care and machine washable 100% cotton white terry towels have no lint after washing them, no fuzz on your body, no color bleeding and highly absorbent like its designated purpose. Leaves no moisture on your body. Holds up after many washes and quality is still top notch. DESIGN : Maura Textured two-ply cotton bath towels dries you better, more durable, gives you real drying feeling right after the shower. Mitre-fold sewn labels can be used to hang your towels in your bathroom. No more falling towels from hanger. We make your every day life easier. QUALITY: Our towels collections are Made in Green by OEKO-TEX certified M1YLC16G2, meaning that everything from the dyes and fabrics tested and verified as free from harmful levels of more than 300 substances. Hems are double stitched for extra durability. CORE CLASSIC SHADES: We applied the most widely used and recognized colors to these luxury towels for fashion, textile, home and interior design. Brings confidence and elegance into your bathroom. PERFECT WEIGHT & SIZE: Towels are 550gsm, which are not bulky to move around on your body and travel friendly, easy to pack as gym towel or pool towel and quick dry. If you think 27\"x54\" is too small, we also carry white bath sheet size you can upgrade to 35\" x 70\". Hand towels are 16\" x 30 and wash cloths are 13\" x 13\".","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1aUWCavuUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MAURA","source_asin":"B08PMSWC2R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-312116","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PMSWC2R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08PMSWC2R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":312117,"name":"The Golden Ship of Wealth Feng Shui with Glass Base","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91eVbvy8XhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Usher in wealth with a ship full of ingots and Chinese coins! The symbol of a sailing ship is very auspicious in Chinese households since it 'ushers' in wealth and material happiness. The Chinese would fill up their ship miniatures with gold items and place them in a prominent position at home or in the office. In those old days, merchant ships brought home much barter, particularly silk and gold. The Golden Ship of Wealth is a beautiful piece of Feng Shui decor that takes away the added homework of adding gold pieces in the ship. Made of high quality clay material and coated with brilliant gold color, this item is auspicious, lovely and very Oriental-themed indeed. Do not in any terms place the nose facing the exit door of the home or office, because this would mean you sailing your wealth away out the door!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91eVbvy8XhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Power Sport","source_asin":"B00AY76OCM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-312117","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00AY76OCM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00AY76OCM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
