window.products.push({"id":312270,"name":"Olive Oil Dispenser Bottle,Automatic opening and closing oil pot,17 Ounce Cooking Oil Cruet Glass,No Drip,Big Oil and Vinegar Dispenser, Lead-Free Gla","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.07,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51RU3JUfPWL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The Best Kitchen Dispensers For Pouring & Cooking Lead-free glass clear, bright, and non-toxic, widely used in food glass containers.The ergonomic glass bottle design gives you full control to precisely pour the amount of olive oil you need . Don't worry about oil leaking,seal ring keep olive oil fresh,it will prevent oil oxidation Specifications: Material: 304 Stainless steel cap+Borosilicate Glass - Set includes two glass bottles, one for olive oil and one for vinegar or sause or other liquids. - With large bottle neck, It is easy and convenient for you to refill the liquid easily without spill. - Stainless-steel gravity spouts open for pouring and close when set down. - Scale for smart cooking. -Keep your olive oil fresh,Easy cleaning within few minutes - Lid made of food grade 304 Stainless stee is solid and reliable for long term use.Soft leather ring, good seal,it is perfect for apple cider, vinegar balsamic vinegar & olive oil as it is air tight Precautions: Glass products, gently, do not close to the burning stove, so that the bottle cap heat deformation The glass part of the product can withstand 120 °, can be soaked in high temperature cleaning ►CLEANING TIPS: Baking soda can be soaked in soda water for 30 minutes after baking soda, then gently wipe off dirt with soft brush, then rinse with water. ►WHITE VINEGAR CLEANING Soak the oil bottle in diluted acid and vinegar for 30 minutes. Gently remove the dirt with a soft brush, then rinse it with clean water. ►TOOTHPASTE CLEANING Wipe the toothpaste oiler, do not touch the water, brush the dirt lightly with soft brush, then rinse it with clean water. Parts Included: 1*17 oz olive oil bottle","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51RU3JUfPWL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SY-Athena","source_asin":"B0891ZCPHH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-312270","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0891ZCPHH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0891ZCPHH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":312271,"name":"Household Essentials Large Fabric Storage Box With Lid Box, Black, Set of 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6117CpiXkoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This sturdy and stylish storage box with lid provides limitless organizational functionality for your dressers, closets, basements, or home storage areas. Its timeless design, natural color, and fashionable brown trim create an aesthetically pleasing alternative for plastic totes or old shoebox makeshift storage solutions designed to hide clutter. The storage container is made of a poly linen and is reinforced with solid siding for added stability, durability, and stackability. The latte canvas blend provides optimal protection from dirt, dust, cobwebs, moths, and other potentially damaging elements in your home, yet offers breathability so your woven items won’t fall victim to stale or stuffy odors over time. Each box features a single decorative handle for easy, one-handed access at all times. These wide storage boxes blend neatly with any home decor and certainly don’t have to be relegated to out-of-sight areas. Ideal in any home storage application, these storage boxes are perfect for bedrooms (sheets, pillows), bathrooms (towels, washcloths, toiletries), attics (collectibles, antiques), home offices (office supplies, craft supplies), or anywhere else clutter tends to collect. When not in use, the box folds flat and can be tucked away easily without taking up valuable excess space. Attractive and functional, this storage box with lid is the perfect solution for your home’s organizational challenges.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6117CpiXkoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Household Essentials","source_asin":"B0C4K52WPT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-312271","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4K52WPT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4K52WPT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":312272,"name":"HOGOWARE Set of 5 Premium Silicone Lids for Bowls and Food Covers - 6, 8, 10, 12, 13.5\" - Brick Red Suction Lid - Reusable - Microwave Airtight Seal L","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719fU9EqQ+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🥓This AIRTIGHT SEAL LID COVER for Pots, Pans, Bowls, Cups, Skillets is silicone BPA. The lid prevents the moisture from the foods from evaporating while cooking or in transit, so you can enjoy all your food safely. It is also DISHWASHER SAFE, which makes it easy to clean and wash; this cover is built to last! 🥐DON’T LET HEAT RUIN YOUR NEXT MEAL. Silicone Suction Lids are the only dish covers that are made from heat resistant silicone. They will hold their shape, even at extreme temperatures such as deep frying and searing, and stay cool in the microwave or refrigerator. 🍕TIRED OF OVER-HEATING YOUR FAVORITE MEALS? Use this silicone suction lid to create a microwave Airtight Seal. Safely seal anything you can think of in the microwave to ensure that your food stays hot and tasty! Our silicone lids have an airtight seal which keeps moisture and condensation out of your food, keeping it fresh for longer. The bright colors of these silicone lids make them ideal for use on a variety of different sized pots, pans and bowls. 🥮MADE OF TOP-QUALITY SILICONE, it's heat resistant to 450 degrees and can be used on various bowls and pots. The cover is microwave safe, so you can use it in the oven or on the stovetop. It also can be used for extra storage in the fridge, freezer and oven for leftovers. It has a tight seal that keeps food nice and fresh for hours (or more depending on how hot/cold it is. 🧆PERFECT SOLUTION - When you’re in the middle of a quick getaway and it’s too hot to leave the laptop at home, but you don’t want to risk eating your food cold, these silicone lid covers are the solution. They fit over any 6 - 13.5 inch bowls, saucepans, cereal bowls, and more. Not only do they PROVIDE EXTRA PROTECTION for your dishes, but they help everyone else feel comfortable knowing that no one will be able to cheat on their portion sizes when eating with these bad boys around.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719fU9EqQ+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOGOWARE","source_asin":"B08BLW5XQF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-312272","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BLW5XQF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BLW5XQF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
