window.products.push({"id":312276,"name":"jinchan Blackout Curtains for Bedroom 63 Inch Length Linen Textured Greyish Beige Curtains Grommet Top 100% Black Out Curtains for Living Room Modern ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81U+clo8nnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Full Blackout Curtains: Creating a cozy atmosphere in your bedroom begins with JINCHAN textured blackout curtains. Package includes 2 panels in 50 inch wide by 63 inch long each, 100 by 63 combined, these linen panels dress up your home into a modern look. Effective Light Blocking: Made of substantial fabric, these window curtains feature a blackout coating for maximum light and heat control. They can block out sunlight effectively, soften outside noise, and regulate the temperature, creating a dark, quiet and warm space for you to relax. Grommet Top Style: Designed with classic top construction, these beige drapes are easy to hang and slide smoothly. Each panel features 8 grommets with 1.6-inch inner diameter, which fit with most curtain rods. Hang them alone or pair them with sheers for a different style. Style It Your Way: Natural linen texture mixes muted colors in these room darkening curtain panels that bring some decorative flair whichever room they're placed in. They can be installed in the living room, bedroom, dining room, kitchen, office, patio door, and nursery for everyday use. Easy Maintenance: These window treatments can withstand tear and wear thanks to the durable material. They are also easy to care. Machine washable in cold water with no bleach. Wash with similar colors. Tumble dry in low heat. Remove the folding line with an iron or steam the front side.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81U+clo8nnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"jinchan","source_asin":"B08Q3WCFQR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-312276","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Q3WCFQR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Q3WCFQR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":312277,"name":"TOSMO Pure Linen Sheets Set, 100% French Natural Linen Flax Bedding 3pc Set(Twin, 1 Flat Sheet, 1 Fitted Sheet,1 Pillowcase)- Butternut","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":119.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51tOIiBMssL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% Natural Linen: Made exclusively from high quality French grown long-staple flax, The linen beding set has been certified by OEKO-TEX Standard 100 and EUROPEAN FLAX certification. Hypoallergenic organic sheets naturally grown and processed without chemicals or additives, harvested in an environmentally friendly manner. Feel Comfortable All-year-round: TOSMO Linen Sheets set is made of 100% high-quality French linen which has nice temperature control feature that can absorb 20% of its weight in moisture before beginning to feel damp or wet which means you'll be cool in summer and cosy in winter. And it helps you fall asleep faster and sleep sounder, ensuring the cozy sleeping a year-round.The perfect sheets for hot sleepers. More Soft and Durable: Stone washed for glossiness, fine durability as well as soft hand feeling, Linen will get softer with every wash as it is a slender and natural fiber. It has the capability of self-cleaning, so there is no need to wash it frequently. In addition, linen is more durable than cotton plus our sheets has a 175-180 GSM, much higher than average 130-160GSM. Which means it will not break down as fast, so you can use it for years. What You Get: Tosmo linen sheet sets Twin Size includes, a flat sheet in 66\"x96E\", a fitted sheet in 39\"x75\", and a Pillowcase in 20\"x30\". The fitted sheet has a 16.5\" deep pocket design with 360° elastic surrounding, suitable for most mattress. Satisfied Service: We are using the finest material in production and have mutiple inspections before it arrive on your hand. But there may still have parts we did not considered that unsatisfy you. That's why we are here all the time for you. Just send us a message and we will help you out. Your satisfaction is our motivation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51tOIiBMssL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TOSMO","source_asin":"B08PCW868V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-312277","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PCW868V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08PCW868V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
