window.products.push({"id":312288,"name":"54mm Bottomless Portafilter compatible with Breville and Solis - CULIKEM Stainless Steel Head and Natural Wood Handle Portafilter Fits for 54mm Brevil","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GtJ5lK9ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Compatible: This 54mm Bottomless Portafilter compatible with some Breville and Solis espresso machines: including the Breville Barista Touch(BES880BSS), Barista Pro(BES878BSS, BES878DBL), Barista Express Impress(BES876BSS), Barista Express(BES870XL, BES870BSXL), Infuser(BES840XL, BES840BSXL, BES840CBXL), Duo-Temp Pro(BES810BSS), Bambino Plus(BES500BSS), Bambino(BES450BSS), and Solis Perfetta Plus, Grind & Infuse(91498074). Users of other models should not purchase. It Makes You a Professional Baristas: Through this bottomless portafilter you can visually see where the espresso is going, flow rate, color, and by observing the state of coffee extraction, find extraction flaws and errors such as channeling and spurting, improve your coffee making skills. Stainless Steel Food Grade Material: There are two kinds of materials for the head of the bottomless portafilter on the market: aluminum alloy and stainless steel. Aluminum alloy is not suitable for contact with food, but its surface has been electroplated, so it looks brighter than stainless steel. Please don't be fooled by its appearance; Our portafilter is made of stainless steel. Its surface is matte. It is a real food grade material. Pure Natural Wood Grain: The pure natural wood handle from the distant Brazilian forest farm. The matte natural wood grain adds a little warmth and beauty to your espresso production area; The weight in your hand can make you feel the love of nature. Detachable: If you want to clean the head of bottomless portafilter but don't want to get the wooden handle wet, you can unscrew the head from the handle, wash the head separately, and easily tighten after washing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GtJ5lK9ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CULIKEM","source_asin":"B0B3J7MPSS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-312288","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3J7MPSS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3J7MPSS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
