window.products.push({"id":312300,"name":"HIARUO 3-Piece Queen Quilt Set - Soft Warm Ultrasonic Ruffled Reversible Coverlet Bedspread Set (90 x 90 Inch) with 2 Pillow Sham (20 x 26 Inch), Gree","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Ot8XL4PvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ELEGANT REVERSIBLE QUILT SET WITH RUFFLED EDGES : Features soft crinkle fabric on the front side and the square embroidery pattern makes this quilt more three-dimensional. The elegant ruffles around the sides makes your room stylish and luxurious; Reverse side adopts smooth fabric, A different side a different day, a fresh mind for a fresh new day QUILTED DESIGN & DURABLE : Stitching design of the quilt set secures the filling in place to maintain fluffy and more durable, help to hold up better in daily usage and laundry. The lightweight bedspread coverlet set is suitable for master bedroom, guest room, dormitory, daybed bedding, sofa, camping and so on. It can be used as a quilt alone in spring and summer, and can be used as a bed cover or blanket to keep warm in winter. WARM, SOFT, COMFORTABLE: Our quilt bedding set is made of premium washed microfiber on the front and brushed microfiber underneath for ultimate softness and comfort. Lightweight but warm, give you a cozy feel and the most relaxing sleep at night. WHAT YOU WILL GET: Queen quilt set - 1 x Queen Quilt(90in*90in), 2 x Pillow Sham(20in*26in); Also available in King Set - 1 x King Quilt(104in*90in), 2 x Pillow Sham(20in*36in). Please note that the bed sheet is not included, it would better to figure out the size of your bed before ordering. CHOOSE THE COLOURS YOU LIKE & WARRANTY - The quilt sets are available in White, pink, navy and grey. Machine wash cold, gentle cycle and air dry. No Iron. We provide 3-month warranty for our quilt. Please feel free to contact us if there is any concern when you receive the product","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Ot8XL4PvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HIARUO","source_asin":"B09H6SSC3V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-312300","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09H6SSC3V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09H6SSC3V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":312301,"name":"Guangzhou Glass Tea Pitcher with Spout Cha Hai Fair Cup Modern Chinese Teaware (Clear, Curved)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qE+I1lY-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"With a passion for things pure and easthetically pleasing to the eys, we proudly present this tea pitcher to all who loves to drink tea and coffee and even just plain water. We used temperated glass which is famous for very low thermal expansion, making this piece resistant to thermal shock, more than any common glass.   Highlights The pitcher has a cylindrical shape that expands at the base and slightly narrows to the top. The convenient handle allows serving hot drinks confidently without risk of scalded fingers. Perfect for serving any beverage, from tea to cocktails to water and fruit juices Showcasing a traditional design that features a gorgeous yet sturdy handle, this glass jug is ideal for tea parties, BBQs and everyday use.   Tips for glassware use and care Use soft tissues or cloth to dry it – this will keep the glass shiny and prevent scratches on the surface of the glass. Fight water stains with baking soda or lemon and hot water. Do not expose glassware to sudden extremes of temperatures (placing hot teapot in the freezer is a recipe for disaster). Don’t use metal spoons. It can lead to glass becoming weak. Use hot, not boiling, water.   Warranty   We are sure about the high quality of our products. That's why we offer the 30-day money back guarantee on all tea accessories. If you don't like the pitcher for any reason, return it within 30 days and get a full refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qE+I1lY-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pacific Tea","source_asin":"B06Y61BJT4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-312301","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06Y61BJT4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06Y61BJT4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
