window.products.push({"id":312587,"name":"Buld&Co. Turkish Towels Set (Set of 4), 100% Cotton Turkish XL Beach Bath Towels, Turkish Hammam Towel, Mixed Colors Lightweight Quick Dry Beach Pesht","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91PMtvudqiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE HISTORY BEHIND THE PRODUCT Buld&Co. Turkish Hand Towels are made of 100% natural Turkish cotton. Unlike any other towels, Buld&Co. Turkish towels pre-washed, more thick, heavier and so more absorbent. What makes our products special is not being mass produced. Our peshtemals are produced in a small town called Buldan which is in city of Denizli in Turkey. The history of this region in weaving dates back to Roman period. Also during Ottoman period, this small town used to provide many kind of textile product the Ottoman Sultans palace needed. Buldan is still dominated by small family businesses based on traditional production techniques. Unlike other ordinary products, by purchasing this product, you will be holding a piece of culture in your hands. THE HERITAGE Peshtemal, generally known as Turkish Towel, is Farsi originated Word means “cloth/cover for back”. The history of Turkish Towel dates back to hundreds of years as part of Turkish Hammam, generally known as Turkish Bath, culture. As its lightness, quick drying and absorptivity, peshtemal is being used not only in hammams but also it became a part of daily use in homes. It is today, due to these characteristics, frequently preferred for beach use and with new designs and colors, it is rapidly becoming a trend among young people. Also due to its ease of use, quality, healthiness, different kinds of product are derived such as bathrobes, rugs, blankets, bags and so on. Best use of Turkish Towel is as, Beach towel Bath towel Turkish Bath towel Picnic blanket Shawl Yoga mat Table cloth and so on Features: 1-Light weight 2-Quick dry 3-%100 cotton, no harming materials to human health 4-Soft and comfortable texture 5-Highest quality","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91PMtvudqiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Buld&Co.","source_asin":"B089RM6MZ9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-312587","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089RM6MZ9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089RM6MZ9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
