window.products.push({"id":312682,"name":"Endea Graduation Mixed Triple Color Tassel with Silver Stacked Date Drop (Black/Light Blue/White, 2022)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51tWRr2WakL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Key Product Features: * Comes with silver stacked year date drop * 9” long with 6.5” hang loop * Free moving and lightweight, solid stacked year charm Signet Product Description: MIXED TRIPLE COLORED STACKED GRADUATION TASSEL SHOWS OFF SCHOOL PRIDE AND COMPLETES YOUR GRADUATION LOOK- GREAT KEEPSAKE! Mixed Triple-Color Graduation Tassel: Complete the graduation look and show off your school pride with a mixed two-colored tassel! We offer a large variety of colors for tassels for customization. Each tassel comes with a commemorative stacked year signet. Order a tassel or two for graduation! Tassels are the perfect memento to keep with you wherever you go after commencement and are exactly what you need to complete your graduation look!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51tWRr2WakL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Endea Graduation","source_asin":"B09FR8Z7KK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-312682","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FR8Z7KK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FR8Z7KK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":312683,"name":"Privacy Window Film, Translucent Frosted Glass Door Tint with White Pattern Non-Adhesive Static Clings for Home Office Decoration, Anti-UV, Heat Contr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eMWXqHh4L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Package Included: 1 x glass window film1 x simple step-by-step instructions Totally Reusable, Fantastic Eco Choice No Residue left on the glass at all, you can reposition it and reuse it after years, ideal for rental places. Tips: When applying in cold weather: Soft the film up by blowing hot air to it using a hair dryer(Heat Resistant up to 176℉) Works on SMOOTH, FLAT and CLEAN GLASS surfaces. Does not apply to frosted glass, cut glass or art glassMore efficient to work with others while putting it upAffix Scotch Tape on a corner of the back side(the smooth side) to quickly remove the backing film Don't know how to use it? Don't worry, the static cling film is very easy to apply ! Step 1. Keep Window or Glass clean, and trim Films to required size (Extend 1~2cm) Step 2. Wet the Window or Glass with water.( Soapy water will be better ) Step 3. Remove the Static Film from backing protect sheet, and then the smooth side should be post to the window ( Please MAKE SURE you have removed it before you apply the window film to glass) Step 4. When you install it, Apply to wet glass and smooth with handsStep 5. Squeegee away water and air bubbles, and cut the excessive edge carefullyStep 6. Much easier than Wall Decals, it's no problem for youStep 7. Enjoy your works! GENUINE CUSTOMER SERVICE: Contact us anytime via Amazon for a free refund or replacement, no question asked, no return necessary! For any product related questions or concerns, just let us know and we'll endeavor to respond within 24hrs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eMWXqHh4L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jahoot","source_asin":"B0833X9TP9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-312683","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0833X9TP9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0833X9TP9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
