window.products.push({"id":312903,"name":"Home Intuition Heavy Glass Canister Set with Airtight Lid 3-Piece Set, Kitchen & Bathroom Apothecary Glass Jars For Candies, Cereal, Nuts & Bathroom S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/918-ymKA5HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[3-PIECE SET] THE CUTE WAY TO BRING ORDER TO YOUR KITCHEN & BATHROOM: This beautiful and super versatile set of glass canisters includes 3 jars with a discreet embossed “QUALITY” design that would look amazing on any kitchen or bathroom countertop. The clear glass also allows you to easily check on the inside of each jar for even easier use! [3-PIECE SET] THE CUTE WAY TO BRING ORDER TO YOUR KITCHEN & BATHROOM: This beautiful and super versatile set of glass canisters includes 3 jars with a discreet embossed “QUALITY” design that would look amazing on any kitchen or bathroom countertop. The clear glass also allows you to easily check on the inside of each jar for even easier use! AIRTIGHT LIDS & GLASS JARS FOR UNBEATABLE FRESHNESS: Thanks to their clear glass construction and airtight lids, our canisters help maintain any food fresh for longer. Perfect for any type of coffee, tea, salt, candy, spices and so much more. Plus, made of premium BPA-free glass material, the lids are 100% leakproof to prevent any messy spills and keeps all your favorite ingredients as fresh and safe as possible. WIDE MOUTH FOR EASY SCOOPING & REFILLING: For your comfort, all 3 jar canisters feature a wide mouth that allows for easy scooping and refilling. These glass storage containers with lids are also big enough to store large portions of cooking and baking ingredients to cover all your different needs. [3 Sizes: 35 oz. 45 oz. and 53 oz.] THE MOST MULTIPURPOSE STORAGE SET FOR ANY ROOM: With 3 different sized apothecary jars per set, you can keep all your kitchen staples nicely stored and right by your side. Great for cookies, candies, pasta, rice, coffee beans, nuts, cereal, sprinkles, flour, sugar, oats or even dog treats, bath bombs, laundry detergent, and makeup wipes. No more messy storage bags, no more stale ingredients! BEAUTIFUL, SPACE-SAVING DESIGN FOR ANY KITCHEN: Made of thick and durable clear glass, the Home Intuition Canister set can be used inside any cabinet, on your pantry shelves or just on your countertop to maximize your storage space without messing up with your kitchen’s décor. Sleek, elegant, and timelessly attractive, this candy jar set is sure to stay in your kitchen for years!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/918-ymKA5HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home Intuition","source_asin":"B07DWHCLL9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-312903","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DWHCLL9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DWHCLL9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
